# Alien gunner: 64x64. idle 0-4, run as walk 16-23, shoot 32-36, death 48-54; run-and-gun rows left unimported.
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet alien.ppm
cell 64 64

bank ALIEN
seq IDLE   loop ticks=4 : lin 0-4
seq WALK   loop ticks=2 : lin 16-23
seq ATTACK once ticks=2 : lin 32-36
seq DEATH  once ticks=3 : lin 48-54
